    title = {Empowering Control Engineering Students Through Theory, Implementation, and AI-Assisted Learning: Evaluating a Project-Based Advanced Computer Control Course⁎⁎This work was supported by the National Institute of Biomedical Imaging and Bioengineering of the National Institutes of Health under award number R01EB029766.},
