@incollection{MACHADO2026322,
    abstract = {Artificially intelligent transformative tools, like chatgpt, are intended to produce sophisticated text that is indistinguishable from that written by a human and are applicable in a wide range of circumstances in the digital world where we are connected by invisible threads of information. This calls into question the following: What is Chatgpt? What role will chatgpt play in schooling going forward? The goal of mapping the future of education using chatgpt in light of the bibliometric review was outlined in response to this issue. A bibliographic search was done in the Web of Science database for this purpose. That Chatgpt, which is utilized in numerous social areas, was found. In the future of education, it will be useful for both teachers and pupils. In addition to teaching and training, this chatgpt can be used for scheduling, question prediction, entertainment, and code debugging.},
